  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5401.03 Digital network",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5401.03 “Digital network” means “digital network” as defined in RSA 376-A:1, II, namely, “any online enabled technology application service, website, or system offered or utilized by a transportation network company that enables the prearrangement of rides with transportation network company drivers.”\n\nSource. #12491, eff 4-2-18",
